NUDE http://nethack.unfoog.de/ does have a live tracker that uses
Aardvark Joes extended logfile facilities to broadcast announcements
like achievements
"$PLAYER defeated Medusa after 19744 turns",
"$PLAYER obtained the sokoban prize after 4237 turns."

or wishes:
"$PLAYER wished for 'blessed greased +2 silver dragon scale mail'
after 1820 turns."

The livelog patch is at:
https://svn.unfoog.de/repo/nethack/patches/nethack/190--livelog.patch

> At least for wishes: http://alt.org/nethack/wishes.html 

"This page last updated on Sun Sep 17 14:10:26 2006"

This is not a live tracker, but a list that got compiled by running
Shawn Moores ttywish program on NAOs ttyrec. 

See this thread:
http://groups.google.com/group/rec.games.roguelike.nethack/browse_frm/thread/10485319de8dcc0f

